WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.477
Welcome to LATYS. This is your command center. Every project gets its own canvas, where your agents, terminals and tools all live together.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:15.682
Zoom out, and you can see every project at once. Your agents keep working in the background, even when you're looking somewhere else.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:21.492
Click any project to dive right in. Or press Control, Shift, P, to cycle through them.
